                                "sense_id": "b18e1b3b-3277-372e-8586-bd511dacc2e3",
                                "text": "If it is not cooked for hours the inevitable result will be disordered digestion and an overheated system. The outway for trouble of that kind is through the dog's skin, and perpetual scratching […]"
