                                "example_id": "f9df255f-f349-4ca6-b831-6ebeae40c99e",
                                "sense_id": "b18e1b3b-3277-372e-8586-bd511dacc2e3",
                                "text": "So they came into the outway. / It was Sunday, what a black day."
